{"id":"bezer","name":"Bezer","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:bezer"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Bezer","text":"Ore of gold or silver. (1.) A city of the Reubenites; one of the three cities of refuge on the east of Jordan (Deut. 4: 43; Josh. 20:8). It has been identified with the modern ruined village of Burazin, some 12 miles north of Heshbon; also with Kasur-el-Besheir, 2 miles south-west of Dibon. (2.) A descendant of Asher (1 Chr. 7:37)."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H1221","lemma":"בֶּצֶר","xlit":"Betser","gloss":"Betser, a place in Palestine","kjv":"Bezer","count":5,"share":1},{"strong":"H7205","lemma":"רְאוּבֵן","xlit":"Rᵉʼûwbên","gloss":"Reuben, a son of Jacob","kjv":"Reuben","count":3,"share":0.6},{"strong":"H7216","lemma":"רָאמוֹת","xlit":"Râʼmôwth","gloss":"Ramoth, the name of two places in Palestine","kjv":"Ramoth","count":2,"share":0.4},{"strong":"H1474","lemma":"גּוֹלָן","xlit":"Gôwlân","gloss":"Golan, a place east of the Jordan","kjv":"Golan","count":2,"share":0.4},{"strong":"H3096","lemma":"יַהַץ","xlit":"Yahats","gloss":"Jahats or Jahtsah, a place East of the Jordan","kjv":"Jahaz, Jahazah, Jahzah","count":2,"share":0.4},{"strong":"H4057","lemma":"מִדְבָּר","xlit":"midbâr","gloss":"a pasture","kjv":"desert, south, speech, wilderness","count":3,"share":0.6}],"verses":["Deut.4.43","Josh.20.8","Josh.21.36","1Chr.6.78","1Chr.7.37"],"related":[{"id":"gad-the-tribe-of","type":"lexical","strong":"H7205","why":"both lead with רְאוּבֵן (H7205)"},{"id":"haste","type":"lexical","strong":"H7205","why":"both lead with רְאוּבֵן (H7205)"},{"id":"misjudgment","type":"lexical","strong":"H7205","why":"both lead with רְאוּבֵן (H7205)"},{"id":"motive","type":"lexical","strong":"H7205","why":"both lead with רְאוּבֵן (H7205)"},{"id":"reuben","type":"lexical","strong":"H7205","why":"both lead with רְאוּבֵן (H7205)"},{"id":"reuben-the-tribe-of","type":"lexical","strong":"H7205","why":"both lead with רְאוּבֵן (H7205)"}],"works":[{"wo